{"id":"b1b421c8b0b990ce","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-strong-embed.md","title":"Strong Embedding Theorem","display":"thm-strong-embed — Strong Embedding Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-strong-embed","aliases":["58-thm-strong-embed"],"display":"thm-strong-embed — Strong Embedding Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-strong.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-strong-embed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-strong-embed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-strong-embed — Strong Embedding Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66e7bdc463325f8b\" href=\"?note=66e7bdc463325f8b\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-strong.md\">../batch15/58-df-strong.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c58d8be3b47a5f9\" href=\"?note=1c58d8be3b47a5f9\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span>（强基数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"66e7bdc463325f8b\" href=\"?note=66e7bdc463325f8b\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-strong.md\">../batch15/58-df-strong.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda&gt;\\kappa\">\\(\\lambda&gt;\\kappa\\)</span>（序数高度）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span>（序数谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)\\)</span>（定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、目标为传递类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的类初等嵌入谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1c58d8be3b47a5f9\" href=\"?note=1c58d8be3b47a5f9\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}\">\\(\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}\\)</span>（环境类元理论中的量词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}\\)</span>（临界点）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}strong\\text{-}embed}\\vdash\n\\left(\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda&gt;\\kappa\\right)\\to\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}M,j\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)\\land\n\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land V_\\lambda\\subseteq M\n\\land\\lambda&lt;j(\\kappa)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}strong\\text{-}embed}\\vdash\n\\left(\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda&gt;\\kappa\\right)\\to\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}M,j\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)\\land\n\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land V_\\lambda\\subseteq M\n\\land\\lambda&lt;j(\\kappa)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>强基数的核心是：对每个高度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda&gt;\\kappa\">\\(\\lambda&gt;\\kappa\\)</span>，存在临界点为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 且目标模型包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\lambda\">\\(V_\\lambda\\)</span> 的初等嵌入。</li>\n<li>仅写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to M\">\\(j:V\\to M\\)</span> 不足以表达初等性；这里直接复用上游二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)\\)</span>，并保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\lambda\\subseteq M\">\\(V_\\lambda\\subseteq M\\)</span> 与严格不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda&lt;j(\\kappa)\">\\(\\lambda&lt;j(\\kappa)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,j\">\\(M,j\\)</span> 是类元理论对象，不能退化成集合量词下的两个对象。</li>\n<li>强基数的一致性强度低于超紧基数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-strong.md","status":"resolved","id":"66e7bdc463325f8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-strong.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c58d8be3b47a5f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-strong.md","status":"resolved","id":"66e7bdc463325f8b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa)$（强基数谓词，见 [[../batch15/58-df-strong.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c58d8be3b47a5f9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)$（定义域为 $V$、目标为传递类 $M$ 的类初等嵌入谓词，见 [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda>\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{crit}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}strong\\text{-}embed}\\vdash\n\\left(\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda>\\kappa\\right)\\to\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}M,j\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)\\land\n\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land V_\\lambda\\subseteq M\n\\land\\lambda<j(\\kappa)\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda>\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"j:V\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\lambda\\subseteq M","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda<j(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"M,j","display":false}],"bytes":1629,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4444","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-thm-strong-embed.md|58-thm-strong-embed]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["66e7bdc463325f8b","1c58d8be3b47a5f9","5582a281f15a33c2"]}